              <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-red-700 dark:text-red-400">Critical Shock</td>
              <td class="p-3">Severe cellular hypoperfusion, kidney ischemia, lactic acidosis.</td>
              <td class="p-3">Emergency IV fluids, vasopressors, shock workup.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-950/20">
