            </h3>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            Nurses utilize the <strong>map calculator nursing</strong> method because MAP represents sustained perfusion pressure across the entire heartbeat, guiding accurate fluid and vasopressor titration.
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4.5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900">
